flowchart TD
  TOOL[Tool request] --> PLAN{Plan and non-read?}
  PLAN -->|Yes| DENY[Deny]
  PLAN -->|No| RULE{Explicit deny matches?}
  RULE -->|Yes| DENY
  RULE -->|No| OUT{Outside workspace?}
  OUT -->|Yes| FULL{Full access?}
  FULL -->|Yes| ALLOW[Allow]
  FULL -->|No| READPLAN{Plan mode?}
  READPLAN -->|Yes| DENY
  READPLAN -->|No| ASK[Ask user]
  OUT -->|No| MATCH{Matching rule?}
  MATCH -->|Yes| ACTION[Use rule action]
  MATCH -->|No| REQUEST{Tool requires approval?}
  REQUEST -->|Yes| ASK
  REQUEST -->|No| DEFAULT[Apply mode default]
